          <Pad Id="PjfStHrn77zMXPQhbxcFpR" Bounds="85,785,840,255" ShowValueBox="true" isIOBox="true" Value="Notes:&#xD;&#xA;- The file is QmlElement Example.qml next to this patch: value (in), percent (changes back), signal milestone(percent).&#xD;&#xA;- Only what the root of the file declares (property ..., signal ...) comes back, not what Item inherits.&#xD;&#xA;- No echo: the value you set is not reported back. Changes QML makes afterwards (animation, bindings) are.&#xD;&#xA;- Auto Size takes width/height of the root (implicitWidth/Height, unless the file declares a size); off: Size sets them.&#xD;&#xA;- Saving the file, another *.qml or qmldir in its folder reloads it; the outputs start empty again. Subfolders and .js are not watched.&#xD;&#xA;- A key removed from Properties is not reset in QML. Errors (syntax, unknown name, wrong type, import of a non-LGPL module) show at Error.&#xD;&#xA;- QML animations follow the frame clock, a QML Timer runs on wall time.&#xD;&#xA;- Types both ways: float, int, bool, string, Color4, Vector2/3/4, RectangleF.">
            <p:TypeAnnotation LastCategoryFullName="Primitive" LastDependency="CoreLibBasics.vl">
              <Choice Kind="TypeFlag" Name="String" />
            </p:TypeAnnotation>
            <p:ValueBoxSettings>
              <p:fontsize p:Type="Int32">9</p:fontsize>
              <p:stringtype p:Assembly="VL.Core" p:Type="VL.Core.StringType">Comment</p:stringtype>
